      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.056
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "这顿饭，究竟为什么会走到法庭上？",
      "sha256": "bb4f454c305ad7fa2007dcd7c5b4b42d5a179465d0f24c7b25bf3b08d3131198",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.984,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.016
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "2022年10月，立命馆大学的校园里，银杏金黄。",
      "sha256": "11250f29bafc6e47994c8d248199f62f98444c7dbf2b71289e12b917e92506e3",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.904,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.096
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "21岁的滨野日菜子，与宫本一希并肩走过小巷。",
      "sha256": "93d21e6cd268ee4bcb34178099556df446d0f4e3c4d1a9feee248b1283c031f7",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.496,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.504
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "十月的一个晚上，两人在居酒屋吃了一顿饭。",
      "sha256": "0bcfaf7535d481bbedf48b36c25513b09db8959b5f7071bf49e9cb597bdb7ff1",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.464,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.536
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "饭后，两人一同回到滨野的公寓。",
      "sha256": "a158344661fd8621b689454ebc6a1017689850883aa55daccffbed2077dde2f9",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 3.744,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.256
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "10月12日，滨野的身体突然不适，父母赶来接她。",
      "sha256": "528e6f67db6b904422dd1dc3b2e546f40a406544dbd0bcd5394dd736f3d888f4",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.064,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.936
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "检方称，宫本没有叫救护车，而是联系了滨野的父母。",
      "sha256": "17a04c12cc6416ef8a9d2e93f10eff15ad1d89c24428f5f90cff40b75b97410f",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.448,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.552
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "距离那顿饭，仅仅过去三天，滨野在医院去世。",
      "sha256": "e00bf3293457d6b41dc23b8983f1a205c13015a58957c065e1e58528f028238b",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.328,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.672
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "那一刻，病房里只剩下监护仪的声音。",
      "sha256": "df37ad748577db06c16b67d0d5f7c9f8324a56218651619cb4a067328756ae10",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.064,
      "atempo": 1.0128,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "转折出现了。据报道，滨野的体内检出了铊这种毒。",
      "sha256": "7dc1d0bf434c5e8b79529c994ea8f64a26fdd7f824847fcc91cfb4f5e94e4660",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.144,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.856
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "铊是一种剧毒金属，它的名字，离大多数人很远。",
      "sha256": "691e24052fc4b9f11fb94d51447b8332e5427fc5f9fde568b9d9c4e4bd1d11c2",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.808,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.192
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "这份报告，让刑警们重新审视整个案子。",
      "sha256": "b69259f6924a1a3d6ac39df5157cc8cac14c3aa751c9417f62ecdceb2d8ce243",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.944,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.056
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "警方因此，把这起事件定为命案。",
      "sha256": "befd5021a6e9c7a6860d4fa26fd8d06c3146930ec82caf3d4a5722123ba50724",
      "voice_id": "voice-00",
      "voice_description": "悬疑低沉、克制的成熟普通话男声",
      "narration_id": "N04",
